  "fleSyntaxBody": "One QSO per line: time, callsign, then optional reports, locator, reference, @name.\nBand, mode or frequency on a line of their own apply to the lines after it (20m, cw, 14.205).\nAfter the first time, only the changed digits are needed: 1734, then 5 means 1735, 40 means 1740.\nDate: date 2026-10-02, or day + for the next day. Time zone: timezone +2 (your local time is then converted to UTC).\nReports: 59, 599, -12. One report is the one you sent.\nMore: <comment>, [QSL message], <tx_pwr:50>.",
